# What `docker build` never needs. Both images build from the repo root
# (apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile), so this one file covers both.

# Secrets: never bake a .env into an image. Settings come from deploy/.env at run time.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Installed packages and build output: each image installs and builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.db

# Tests output, editor and agent files, docs.
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright-mcp
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
docs
deploy
*.log
